<title>NETHERLANDS: BREEVAST 1996 NET HIGHER THAN FORECAST.</title>
<headline>BREEVAST 1996 NET HIGHER THAN FORECAST.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     1.50 vs   2.18</p>
<p>    Net profit			    10.8  vs  15.4</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  0.60 vs   0.50</p>
<p>    Net operating income		64.6  vs  68.2</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     9.4  vs  22.0</p>
<p>    Associates income		    2.3  vs   0.6</p>
<p>    Financial charges		    0.9  vs   7.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Real estate development group Breevast NV previously</p>
<p>said it expected 1996 full-year profit of about 9 mln guilders</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
